From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Anthony Fu (via agent)" <reg-github-bot@antfu.me>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:59:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): customize the pull request quick action prompts

The quick actions above the composer always sent the same built-in
prompt, so a team with its own way to resolve conflicts or open a pull
request had to type it each time. A Quick actions settings page now
edits each prompt, saved on this device; {{url}} and {{base}} are filled
in when it is sent, and an empty prompt goes back to the default.

Fork-Change: F-14
